    <briefdescription>
<para>Dither configuration helper functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides high-level functions to calculate dither parameters from user-friendly values.</para>
<para><bold>Formulas</bold>:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>I_dither = STEPS × STEP_SIZE × 2A / 32767</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>T_dither = [4×STEPS + 2×FLAT] × t_ref_clk</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Where t_ref_clk is set by the per-channel <ref refid="namespacetle92466ed_1_1DITHER__CLK__DIV" kindref="compound">DITHER_CLK_DIV</ref> register (see <ref refid="namespacetle92466ed_1_1DITHER__CLK__DIV" kindref="compound">DITHER_CLK_DIV</ref> namespace above). The chip&apos;s POR default of <ref refid="namespacetle92466ed_1_1DITHER__CLK__DIV" kindref="compound">DITHER_CLK_DIV</ref> = 0x0000 makes t_ref_clk = 0, so any channel that needs feedback values populated MUST have <ref refid="namespacetle92466ed_1_1DITHER__CLK__DIV" kindref="compound">DITHER_CLK_DIV</ref> programmed to a non-zero MANT/EXP combination first. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
